research.FIRSTSTEPS.stage.3=TESTING For me to make any progress as a thaumaturge I cannot rely on simply studying the world around me or stumbling upon ancient knowledge. I will need to make my own discoveries and expand my knowledge through experimentation. Crafting my own theories is the only way.<BR>I will need to create a comfortable workspace to do my research with ample supplies like writing materials and paper. I should craft some scribing tools and place it upon a table.<IMG>thaumcraft:textures/research/research4.png:128:128:128:128:.6</IMG> 

research.THEORYRESEARCH.stage.1=For me to make any progress as a thaumaturge I cannot rely on simply studying the world around me or stumbling upon ancient knowledge. I will need to make my own discoveries and expand my knowledge through experimentation. Coming up with my own theories is the only way.<BR>I will need to create a relaxing and comfortable workspace to do my research. A nice hot cup of tea should do the trick.
research.THEORYRESEARCH.stage.2=Now that i have some tea, i can sit back and relax, and write down any discoveries i make as long as i have my thaumonomicon and scribing tools on hand.<BR>The different types of teas should help me focus on different types of discoveries.<BR>I'm sure if i surround myself with inspiring objects, i can discover things even more quickly!

research.CELESTIALSCANNING.title=Inspiring Environment
research.CELESTIALSCANNING.stage.1=The teas really help me focus and come up with new theories and discoveries, however i think if i can relax even more, i can speed up this process.<BR>Surrounding myself with inspiring and relaxing blocks and items would be a good start.<BR>A nice warm campfire, a bookshelf full of interesting books, a research table, and even the bubbling sound of a crucible all seem to help.
